{
  "account": "plur",
  "background": {"color": "#0A0A0A"},
  "slides": [
    {
      "type": "cover",
      "main": ["GOA TRANCE"],
      "sub": "A saint built a rave out of an ancient ritual."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "Anjuna Beach. Goa. 1960s.",
        "",
        "Hippies arrived",
        "looking for hashish.",
        "",
        "Some of them",
        "never left."
      ],
      "sub": "The shore where it began."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "A teenager from San Francisco",
        "arrives in 1969.",
        "",
        "He meets a guru",
        "in Kashmir.",
        "",
        "He becomes a holy man."
      ],
      "sub": "Not a musician. A pilgrim."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
        "His name is Goa Gil.",
        "",
        "He builds stages in the sand.",
        "Guitars. Full moon. Fire.",
        "",
        "He calls it a ritual.",
        "Not a party."
      ],
      "note": "Anjuna Beach, 1969."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "By the 1980s,",
        "guitars become synthesizers.",
        "",
        "Something colder.",
        "Something faster.",
        "",
        "140 BPM.",
        "Layered with sitar.",
        "Layered with chant."
      ],
      "sub": "The sound found its shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "Israeli soldiers",
        "finish their service.",
        "",
        "They fly to Goa",
        "to forget the noise.",
        "",
        "Some bring the sound home.",
        "",
        "Tel Aviv learns the beat."
      ],
      "sub": "How a ritual becomes a genre."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "2003.",
        "The world found out.",
        "",
        "Police came.",
        "The beach went quiet.",
        "",
        "The music moved",
        "to forests.",
        "To mountains.",
        "To festivals everywhere."
      ],
      "sub": "The ritual survived the raid."
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": [
        "Anjuna is still.",
        "",
        "But the ritual",
        "kept running."
      ],
      "strobe": "The beach is empty. The music is everywhere.",
      "cta": "Save this."
    }
  ]
}
